<title>HONG KONG: Bank of China HK branch launches HK$2 bln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Bank of China HK branch launches HK$2 bln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by arranger China Development Finance Co.</p>
<p>BORROWER BANK OF CHINA ACTING THROUGH ITS HONG KONG BRANCH</p>
<p> AMT	HK$2 BLN    COUPON    1MH+35     MATURITY    5 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE     FRCD	  ISS PRICE PAR	  LAUNCHED    16.SEP.96</p>
<p> PUTS     NONE	  CALLS     NONE	 REPLIES     30.SEP.96</p>
<p> LISTING  NONE	  REPAYMENT BULLET     DENOMS	HK$1 MLN</p>
<p> RATINGS  *	     SALE LMTS CUSTOMARY  PAY DATE    TBA</p>
<p> NEG PLG  NO	    CRS DEF   NO	   FORCE MAJ   NO</p>
<p> GOV LAW  HONG KONG   HOME CTRY CHINA	TAX PROV    NA</p>
<p> NOTES    APPLICATION FOR LAF. *PRELIMINARY RATING OF AA-MINUS</p>
<p>	    FROM JBRI</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES  SNR LEADS  HK$200 MLN 32.5 BP ALL-IN 41.5</p>
<p>			    LEADS	HK$150 MLN 27.5 BP ALL-IN 40.5</p>
<p>			    CO-LEADS   HK$100 MLN 22.5 BP ALL-IN 39.5</p>
<p>			    MANAGERS   HK$50  MLN 17.5 BP ALL-IN 38.5</p>
<p>ARRANGER  CHINA DEVELOPMENT FINANCE CO (BOOKRUNNER)</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6371</p>
</text>
